---
/**
 * DE|RIVE's award graphic — AMP's (Aesthetic Management Partners') own
 * marketing graphic for its DE|RIVE scalp and hair system, carried as-is
 * (only the screenshot frame around it was trimmed, losslessly; the
 * working folder is C:\Amy\derive-graphic). Rendered on
 * /services/regenerative, in the DE|RIVE section, and on
 * /go/regenerative after the cards (the `awardCard` rule in
 * src/lib/landing.ts): the one treatment-page graphic a landing page
 * shows. The maker's OK is on record (operator, 2026-11-05).
 *
 * Its pixels carry legible claims and a package size, under the
 * operator's overrides after the compliance flags (CLAUDE.md
 * constraint 3: its claims bullet, and its fifteenth pixel-level
 * override for the package size; DECISIONS 2026-11-05). The alt text reads the
 * award out (constraint 6, the operator's choice): it is the ONE place
 * the graphic's words are written in site text, through one exact
 * allowedStrings entry in compliance/banned-patterns.json, so the alt
 * stays on ONE source line exactly as registered. No other text from
 * the graphic or its bottle is ever restated — copy, comments, meta, OG,
 * JSON-LD.
 *
 * Not a .media-figure: an image of text stays whole, so neither the arch
 * nor the 4:5 crop of TreatmentLayout reaches it (the lip-style-guide
 * precedent); the frame is the pair gallery's bare recipe.
 *
 * CONSTRAINT 4: this file and its PNG are part of the regenerative
 * page's approved content, but check-approvals reads treatment files
 * only. Any edit to either resets clinicianApproved in
 * src/content/treatments/regenerative.mdx in the same commit.
 */
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import award from '../assets/photos/derive-award.png';
---

<figure class="award-figure">
  <Image
    src={award}
    alt="The Aesthetic Awards winner: Best in Industry, Nonsurgical Innovation, three years running. A DE|RIVE serum bottle and syringe over dark hair."
    widths={[340, 540, 680]}
    sizes="(max-width: 40rem) 90vw, 18rem"
  />
</figure>

<style>
  .award-figure {
    justify-self: center;
    width: min(18rem, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .award-figure :global(img) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--ng-magenta-600);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
</style>
